ans-serif\">উজ্জ্বল</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">প্রাকৃতিক</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">রং</span>, <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কড়া</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ঘ্রাণ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ও</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">গুণমান</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">অক্ষুণ্ণ।</span> </li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কোনো</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">প্রকার</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">কৃত্রিম</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">রং</span>, <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">প্রিজারভেটিভ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বা</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ভেজালমুক্ত।</span> </li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-list:l2 level1 lfo1;tab-stops:list .5in\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">সম্পূর্ণ</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">বিএসটিআই</span> (BSTI) <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">মানদণ্ড</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">ও</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">স্বাস্থ্যসম্মত</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">পরিবেশে</span> <span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">প্যাকেটজাত।</span> </li></ul>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-serif\">প্রক্রিয়াজাতকরণ</span>\r\n</b><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Nirmala UI&quot;,sans-